{"_kind": "doc", "slug": "dbwzg7sugs5gtok2", "title": "110.基于IA3训练Seq2Seq模型", "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><h2 data-lake-id=\"S7DPq\" id=\"S7DPq\"><span data-lake-id=\"u35e79420\" id=\"u35e79420\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #000000\">示例代码</span></h2><card type=\"block\" name=\"localdoc\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.yuque.com%2Fattachments%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fzip%2F2424104%2F1746582257220-f74d982a-1384-4671-8a22-84f37b619367.zip%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22ia3-train.zip%22%2C%22size%22%3A9455%2C%22ext%22%3A%22zip%22%2C%22source%22%3A%22%22%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22download%22%3Atrue%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u0b7b51d2-fc75-40b5-9df6-f0e1679ccd2%22%2C%22taskType%22%3A%22upload%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22application%2Fzip%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22card%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22foOQj%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"sqdiX\" id=\"sqdiX\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue620ce5d\" id=\"ue620ce5d\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">前言</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"ud2beeae4\" id=\"ud2beeae4\"><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/peft/conceptual_guides/ia3\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"uf5429d65\" id=\"uf5429d65\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf1f90e35\" id=\"uf1f90e35\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">IA3</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u878e76e5\" id=\"u878e76e5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> 通过三个学习到的向量来乘模型的激活值（自注意力机制和编码器-解码器注意力模块中的键和值，以及逐位置前馈网络的中间激活值）。这种 PEFT 方法引入的可训练参数数量甚至比 LoRA 更少，LoRA 引入的是权重矩阵而不是向量。原始模型的参数保持冻结，只有这些向量会被更新。因此，为新的下游任务进行微调更快、更便宜、更高效。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u26416ab3\" id=\"u26416ab3\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue73291cd\" id=\"ue73291cd\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">本指南将向您展示如何使用 IA3 训练序列到序列模型，以</span><em><span data-lake-id=\"u1aed0af8\" id=\"u1aed0af8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-500)\">生成给定财经新闻的情感</span></em><span data-lake-id=\"udbef5a58\" id=\"udbef5a58\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u9622b5e7\" id=\"u9622b5e7\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua0df67f2\" id=\"ua0df67f2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: oklch(0.508 0.118 165.612)\">熟悉训练序列到序列模型的一般过程将非常有帮助，并使您能够专注于如何应用 IA3。如果您是新手，我们建议您首先查看 Transformers 文档中的 </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/transformers/tasks/translation\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u3b2dbf73\" id=\"u3b2dbf73\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua1981c59\" id=\"ua1981c59\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: oklch(0.432 0.095 166.913)\">翻译</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u71a91f7f\" id=\"u71a91f7f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: oklch(0.508 0.118 165.612)\"> 和 </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/transformers/tasks/summarization\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"uc0ac5a38\" id=\"uc0ac5a38\"><span data-lake-id=\"udabb55aa\" id=\"udabb55aa\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: oklch(0.432 0.095 166.913)\">摘要</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u5fb8633a\" id=\"u5fb8633a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: oklch(0.508 0.118 165.612)\"> 指南。当您准备好后，再回来看看将 PEFT 融入您的训练有多么容易！</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u1077d3d9\" id=\"u1077d3d9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7b25ecaa\" id=\"u7b25ecaa\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">一般任务类型有以下几种</span></p><h5 data-lake-id=\"ceW34\" id=\"ceW34\" style=\"padding-left: 2em\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud91bc09f\" id=\"ud91bc09f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #000000\">SEQ_CLS</span></h5><blockquote data-lake-id=\"u838e3fc1\" id=\"u838e3fc1\" style=\"padding-left: 2em\"><p data-lake-id=\"u1041f6a9\" id=\"u1041f6a9\" style=\"padding-left: 2em\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7851b1af\" id=\"u7851b1af\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #000000\">序列分类（Sequence Classification），对整个句子进行分类。如: 获取评论的情绪，检测电子邮件是否为垃圾邮件，确定句子在语法上是否正确或两个句子在逻辑上是否相关等</span></p></blockquote><h5 data-lake-id=\"VmBkb\" id=\"VmBkb\" style=\"padding-left: 2em\"><span data-lake-id=\"u79303912\" id=\"u79303912\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #000000\">SEQ_2_SEQ_LM</span></h5><blockquote data-lake-id=\"uc48f35c4\" id=\"uc48f35c4\" style=\"padding-left: 2em\"><p data-lake-id=\"u6e7713e2\" id=\"u6e7713e2\" style=\"padding-left: 2em\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1b7b1d85\" id=\"u1b7b1d85\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #000000\">条件生成任务，根据给定的输入（可能是文本、图片等）生成符合条件的输出。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uaf6c9e7e\" id=\"uaf6c9e7e\" style=\"padding-left: 2em\"><span data-lake-id=\"u19169842\" id=\"u19169842\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #000000\">与因果语言建模任务不同，条件生成不仅仅关注于给定上下文的连贯性，还关注于满足预定的任务要求。因果语言建模仅关注于根据给定的上下文生成文本序列。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u84fda8ce\" id=\"u84fda8ce\" style=\"padding-left: 2em\"><span data-lake-id=\"u34c7c71f\" id=\"u34c7c71f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #000000\">条件生成的应用包括但不限于机器翻译、文本摘要、图像描述等。这些任务通常需要模型在输入和输出之间建立复杂的映射关系。</span></p></blockquote><h5 data-lake-id=\"O1xKS\" id=\"O1xKS\" style=\"padding-left: 2em\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua674105a\" id=\"ua674105a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #000000\">CAUSAL_LM</span></h5><blockquote data-lake-id=\"u93498968\" id=\"u93498968\" style=\"padding-left: 2em\"><p data-lake-id=\"uc7a5c87c\" id=\"uc7a5c87c\" style=\"padding-left: 2em\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub9dd4bca\" id=\"ub9dd4bca\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #000000\">因果语言建模任务（CLM），在这种建模方法中，模型试图预测给定上下文中的下一个单词，该上下文通常包括在当前单词之前的所有单词。这种建模方法遵循因果原则，即当前单词只受到其前面单词的影响，而不受后面单词的影响。代表模型有 GPT2、Bloom、OPT、GPT-Neo、GPT-J、LLaMA、ChatGLM。</span></p></blockquote><h5 data-lake-id=\"ebp1X\" id=\"ebp1X\" style=\"padding-left: 2em\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8cad0804\" id=\"u8cad0804\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #000000\">TOKEN_CLS</span></h5><blockquote data-lake-id=\"u1209cc33\" id=\"u1209cc33\" style=\"padding-left: 2em\"><p data-lake-id=\"u7013b0bb\" id=\"u7013b0bb\" style=\"padding-left: 2em\"><span data-lake-id=\"u50ba8253\" id=\"u50ba8253\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #000000\">Token 分类任务（Token Classification），对句子中的每个词进行分类。如: 识别句子的语法成分（名词、动词、形容词）或命名实体（人、地点、组织）。</span></p></blockquote><h2 data-lake-id=\"e20804e3\" id=\"e20804e3\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc8783b53\" id=\"uc8783b53\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">数据集</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"uf84c2fa7\" id=\"uf84c2fa7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u19b52d6b\" id=\"u19b52d6b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">您将使用</span><span data-lake-id=\"u2f9ac56f\" id=\"u2f9ac56f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/datasets/financial_phrasebank\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ua08cf576\" id=\"ua08cf576\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5a0ae7d7\" id=\"u5a0ae7d7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">financial_phrasebank</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"uee95ae92\" id=\"uee95ae92\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u515b7b2d\" id=\"u515b7b2d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">数据集的 sentences_allagree 子集。此子集包含财经新闻，其中情感标签的标注者一致性为 100%。查看</span><span data-lake-id=\"u7439f93d\" id=\"u7439f93d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/datasets/financial_phrasebank/viewer/sentences_allagree\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u45797867\" id=\"u45797867\"><span data-lake-id=\"u13bd080a\" id=\"u13bd080a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">数据集查看器</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u7aa05121\" id=\"u7aa05121\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">，以更好地了解您将使用的数据和句子。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u25cb5d85\" id=\"u25cb5d85\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0e2fca57\" id=\"u0e2fca57\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">使用</span><span data-lake-id=\"ue1c928e6\" id=\"ue1c928e6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/datasets/v3.4.1/en/package_reference/loading_methods#datasets.load_dataset\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ub351e3bf\" id=\"ub351e3bf\"><span data-lake-id=\"u295da3c7\" id=\"u295da3c7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">load_dataset</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u17bfb67f\" id=\"u17bfb67f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u206ce50c\" id=\"u206ce50c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">函数加载数据集。数据集的此子集仅包含训练拆分，因此使用</span><span data-lake-id=\"ueda948c8\" id=\"ueda948c8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"u4e796f08\" id=\"u4e796f08\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8107fd98\" id=\"u8107fd98\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">train_test_split</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u80998326\" id=\"u80998326\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"ua270b3d4\" id=\"ua270b3d4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">函数创建训练和验证拆分。创建一个新的</span><span data-lake-id=\"u3b8e5653\" id=\"u3b8e5653\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"uf57a2d21\" id=\"uf57a2d21\"><span data-lake-id=\"u35f5b7e9\" id=\"u35f5b7e9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">text_label</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uf254cbaf\" id=\"uf254cbaf\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u541f5940\" id=\"u541f5940\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">列，以便更容易理解</span><span data-lake-id=\"u07dfc4bc\" id=\"u07dfc4bc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"u5450979a\" id=\"u5450979a\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf9881d13\" id=\"uf9881d13\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">label</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ud0003468\" id=\"ud0003468\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"uc0b67242\" id=\"uc0b67242\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">值</span><span data-lake-id=\"u8111bb3b\" id=\"u8111bb3b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"u4a8edd1f\" id=\"u4a8edd1f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u19691b55\" id=\"u19691b55\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">0</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"udd5449ce\" id=\"udd5449ce\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">、</span><code data-lake-id=\"u88cf1f8d\" id=\"u88cf1f8d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0d02f641\" id=\"u0d02f641\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">1</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u4e7ae161\" id=\"u4e7ae161\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"uaa020c01\" id=\"uaa020c01\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">和</span><span data-lake-id=\"udcf68535\" id=\"udcf68535\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"uf4ef897f\" id=\"uf4ef897f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7c12ff37\" id=\"u7c12ff37\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">2</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uf9645c77\" id=\"uf9645c77\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"ub2739be1\" id=\"ub2739be1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">的含义。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20datasets%20import%20load_dataset%5Cn%5Cnds%20%3D%20load_dataset(%5C%22financial_phrasebank%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22sentences_allagree%5C%22)%5Cnds%20%3D%20ds%5B%5C%22train%5C%22%5D.train_test_split(test_size%3D0.1)%5Cnds%5B%5C%22validation%5C%22%5D%20%3D%20ds%5B%5C%22test%5C%22%5D%5Cndel%20ds%5B%5C%22test%5C%22%5D%5Cn%5Cnclasses%20%3D%20ds%5B%5C%22train%5C%22%5D.features%5B%5C%22label%5C%22%5D.names%5Cnds%20%3D%20ds.map(%5Cn%20%20%20%20lambda%20x%3A%20%7B%5C%22text_label%5C%22%3A%20%5Bclasses%5Blabel%5D%20for%20label%20in%20x%5B%5C%22label%5C%22%5D%5D%7D%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20batched%3DTrue%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20num_proc%3D1%2C%5Cn)%5Cn%5Cnds%5B%5C%22train%5C%22%5D%5B0%5D%5Cn%7B'sentence'%3A%20'It%20will%20be%20operated%20by%20Nokia%20%2C%20and%20supported%20by%20its%20Nokia%20NetAct%20network%20and%20service%20management%20system%20.'%2C%5Cn%20'label'%3A%201%2C%5Cn%20'text_label'%3A%20'neutral'%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dwWqR%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u7834ef4c\" id=\"u7834ef4c\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucb653eaa\" id=\"ucb653eaa\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">加载分词器并创建一个预处理函数，该函数将</span></p><ol list=\"ue44a4d3b\"><li fid=\"u13487edf\" data-lake-id=\"u5b0a5a07\" id=\"u5b0a5a07\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3e0547f1\" id=\"u3e0547f1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">对输入进行分词，将序列填充和截断到</span><span data-lake-id=\"u72338278\" id=\"u72338278\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"u31f811e7\" id=\"u31f811e7\"><span data-lake-id=\"uade59cc4\" id=\"uade59cc4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">max_length</span></code></li><li fid=\"u13487edf\" data-lake-id=\"u440bc853\" id=\"u440bc853\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub2ce7233\" id=\"ub2ce7233\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">将相同的分词器应用于标签，但使用与标签对应的较短的</span><span data-lake-id=\"u77227121\" id=\"u77227121\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"uf30774c6\" id=\"uf30774c6\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucd4a4198\" id=\"ucd4a4198\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">max_length</span></code></li><li fid=\"u13487edf\" data-lake-id=\"u0b717eeb\" id=\"u0b717eeb\"><span data-lake-id=\"u71c1b557\" id=\"u71c1b557\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">掩码填充 tokens</span></li></ol><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20transformers%20import%20AutoTokenizer%5Cn%5Cntext_column%20%3D%20%5C%22sentence%5C%22%5Cnlabel_column%20%3D%20%5C%22text_label%5C%22%5Cnmax_length%20%3D%20128%5Cn%5Cntokenizer%20%3D%20AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained(%5C%22bigscience%2Fmt0-large%5C%22)%5Cn%5Cndef%20preprocess_function(examples)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20inputs%20%3D%20examples%5Btext_column%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20targets%20%3D%20examples%5Blabel_column%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20model_inputs%20%3D%20tokenizer(inputs%2C%20max_length%3Dmax_length%2C%20padding%3D%5C%22max_length%5C%22%2C%20truncation%3DTrue%2C%20return_tensors%3D%5C%22pt%5C%22)%5Cn%20%20%20%20labels%20%3D%20tokenizer(targets%2C%20max_length%3D3%2C%20padding%3D%5C%22max_length%5C%22%2C%20truncation%3DTrue%2C%20return_tensors%3D%5C%22pt%5C%22)%5Cn%20%20%20%20labels%20%3D%20labels%5B%5C%22input_ids%5C%22%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20labels%5Blabels%20%3D%3D%20tokenizer.pad_token_id%5D%20%3D%20-100%5Cn%20%20%20%20model_inputs%5B%5C%22labels%5C%22%5D%20%3D%20labels%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20model_inputs%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22K9LFN%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u3c479378\" id=\"u3c479378\"><span data-lake-id=\"u79411503\" id=\"u79411503\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">使用</span><span data-lake-id=\"u56d9a8f7\" id=\"u56d9a8f7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/datasets/v3.4.1/en/package_reference/main_classes#datasets.Dataset.map\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u6e684c77\" id=\"u6e684c77\"><span data-lake-id=\"u284857aa\" id=\"u284857aa\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">map</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u95ca0462\" id=\"u95ca0462\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u21b22feb\" id=\"u21b22feb\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">函数将预处理函数应用于整个数据集。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22processed_ds%20%3D%20ds.map(%5Cn%20%20%20%20preprocess_function%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20batched%3DTrue%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20num_proc%3D1%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20remove_columns%3Dds%5B%5C%22train%5C%22%5D.column_names%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20load_from_cache_file%3DFalse%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20desc%3D%5C%22Running%20tokenizer%20on%20dataset%5C%22%2C%5Cn)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OtU8P%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ubac7059c\" id=\"ubac7059c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u47b2aa04\" id=\"u47b2aa04\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">创建训练和评估</span><span data-lake-id=\"u912b855c\" id=\"u912b855c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><a href=\"https://pytorch.ac.cn/docs/stable/data.html#torch.utils.data.DataLoader\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u48bad91c\" id=\"u48bad91c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8f30a942\" id=\"u8f30a942\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">DataLoader</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u16b08151\" id=\"u16b08151\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">，并设置</span><span data-lake-id=\"ubbd8b9e5\" id=\"ubbd8b9e5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"uee90be23\" id=\"uee90be23\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4f051ae6\" id=\"u4f051ae6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">pin_memory=True</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u7abedfee\" id=\"u7abedfee\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u85b5029c\" id=\"u85b5029c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">以加快数据传输到 GPU 的速度（如果在 CPU 上有数据集样本）。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20torch.utils.data%20import%20DataLoader%5Cnfrom%20transformers%20import%20default_data_collator%5Cn%5Cntrain_ds%20%3D%20processed_ds%5B%5C%22train%5C%22%5D%5Cneval_ds%20%3D%20processed_ds%5B%5C%22validation%5C%22%5D%5Cn%5Cnbatch_size%20%3D%208%5Cn%5Cntrain_dataloader%20%3D%20DataLoader(%5Cn%20%20%20%20train_ds%2C%20shuffle%3DTrue%2C%20collate_fn%3Ddefault_data_collator%2C%20batch_size%3Dbatch_size%2C%20pin_memory%3DTrue%5Cn)%5Cneval_dataloader%20%3D%20DataLoader(eval_ds%2C%20collate_fn%3Ddefault_data_collator%2C%20batch_size%3Dbatch_size%2C%20pin_memory%3DTrue)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Z0UoE%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"8000f187\" id=\"8000f187\"><span data-lake-id=\"uaeeb128c\" id=\"uaeeb128c\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">模型</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u8f5ca14d\" id=\"u8f5ca14d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7604886b\" id=\"u7604886b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">现在您可以加载一个预训练模型，用作 IA3 的基础模型。本指南使用</span><span data-lake-id=\"uc2c6757a\" id=\"uc2c6757a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/bigscience/mt0-large\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u280fe4e7\" id=\"u280fe4e7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3e13a878\" id=\"u3e13a878\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">bigscience/mt0-large</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"uddafcbbf\" id=\"uddafcbbf\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u4b655cdb\" id=\"u4b655cdb\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">模型，但您可以使用任何您喜欢的序列到序列模型。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20transformers%20import%20AutoModelForSeq2SeqLM%5Cn%5Cnmodel%20%3D%20AutoModelForSeq2SeqLM.from_pretrained(%5C%22bigscience%2Fmt0-large%5C%22)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22E2adE%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"35b12e65\" id=\"35b12e65\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9b47efbb\" id=\"u9b47efbb\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">PEFT 配置和模型</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u3aae2c75\" id=\"u3aae2c75\"><span data-lake-id=\"udfdeb109\" id=\"udfdeb109\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">所有 PEFT 方法都需要一个配置，其中包含并指定 PEFT 方法应如何应用的所有参数。创建一个</span><span data-lake-id=\"u04f6256c\" id=\"u04f6256c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/peft/v0.15.0/en/package_reference/ia3#peft.IA3Config\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u6df70682\" id=\"u6df70682\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucab37ee8\" id=\"ucab37ee8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">IA3Config</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u18e98497\" id=\"u18e98497\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">，其中包含任务类型并将推理模式设置为</span><span data-lake-id=\"u01a7dd24\" id=\"u01a7dd24\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"ubb942bf4\" id=\"ubb942bf4\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua70d5b09\" id=\"ua70d5b09\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">False</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u75ba42f3\" id=\"u75ba42f3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">。您可以在</span><span data-lake-id=\"ub6579213\" id=\"ub6579213\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/peft/package_reference/ia3#ia3config\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u6027c97b\" id=\"u6027c97b\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue014b7ae\" id=\"ue014b7ae\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">API 参考</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"ue527d92f\" id=\"ue527d92f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u781dd34f\" id=\"u781dd34f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">中找到此配置的其他参数。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ue8a1cb62\" id=\"ue8a1cb62\"><span data-lake-id=\"u88be7acd\" id=\"u88be7acd\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: oklch(0.508 0.118 165.612)\">调用</span><span data-lake-id=\"u497dfc88\" id=\"u497dfc88\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: oklch(0.508 0.118 165.612)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/peft/v0.15.0/en/package_reference/peft_model#peft.PeftModel.print_trainable_parameters\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u40c97210\" id=\"u40c97210\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7c11f57c\" id=\"u7c11f57c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: oklch(0.432 0.095 166.913)\">print_trainable_parameters()</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"ub5626e9a\" id=\"ub5626e9a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: oklch(0.508 0.118 165.612)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u45dc85d9\" id=\"u45dc85d9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: oklch(0.508 0.118 165.612)\">方法来比较</span><span data-lake-id=\"u4022389c\" id=\"u4022389c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: oklch(0.508 0.118 165.612)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/peft/v0.15.0/en/package_reference/peft_model#peft.PeftModel\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u4ef27096\" id=\"u4ef27096\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9032d9d9\" id=\"u9032d9d9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: oklch(0.432 0.095 166.913)\">PeftModel</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"ud335bc05\" id=\"ud335bc05\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: oklch(0.508 0.118 165.612)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"ucb4aa026\" id=\"ucb4aa026\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: oklch(0.508 0.118 165.612)\">的可训练参数数量与基础模型中的参数数量！</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u37bcd65c\" id=\"u37bcd65c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u538ff1bf\" id=\"u538ff1bf\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">配置设置完成后，将其与基础模型一起传递给</span><span data-lake-id=\"u9bcb0f18\" id=\"u9bcb0f18\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/peft/v0.15.0/en/package_reference/peft_model#peft.get_peft_model\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ue3465772\" id=\"ue3465772\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc2722358\" id=\"uc2722358\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">get_peft_model()</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u96331d88\" id=\"u96331d88\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u83f12ad2\" id=\"u83f12ad2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">函数，以创建一个可训练的</span><span data-lake-id=\"u960b1249\" id=\"u960b1249\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/peft/v0.15.0/en/package_reference/peft_model#peft.PeftModel\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u2ca2d788\" id=\"u2ca2d788\"><span data-lake-id=\"u548acd22\" id=\"u548acd22\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">PeftModel</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u8cd2693f\" id=\"u8cd2693f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20peft%20import%20IA3Config%2C%20get_peft_model%5Cn%5Cnpeft_config%20%3D%20IA3Config(task_type%3D%5C%22SEQ_2_SEQ_LM%5C%22)%5Cnmodel%20%3D%20get_peft_model(model%2C%20peft_config)%5Cnmodel.print_trainable_parameters()%5Cn%5C%22trainable%20params%3A%20282%2C624%20%7C%7C%20all%20params%3A%201%2C229%2C863%2C936%20%7C%7C%20trainable%25%3A%200.022980103060766553%5C%22%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qwese%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"d8b16075\" id=\"d8b16075\"><span data-lake-id=\"u28629f79\" id=\"u28629f79\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">训练</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ub027eb63\" id=\"ub027eb63\"><span data-lake-id=\"u316dd0ea\" id=\"u316dd0ea\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">设置优化器和学习率调度器。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22import%20torch%5Cnfrom%20transformers%20import%20get_linear_schedule_with_warmup%5Cn%5Cnlr%20%3D%208e-3%5Cnnum_epochs%20%3D%203%5Cn%5Cnoptimizer%20%3D%20torch.optim.AdamW(model.parameters()%2C%20lr%3Dlr)%5Cnlr_scheduler%20%3D%20get_linear_schedule_with_warmup(%5Cn%20%20%20%20optimizer%3Doptimizer%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20num_warmup_steps%3D0%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20num_training_steps%3D(len(train_dataloader)%20*%20num_epochs)%2C%5Cn)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nMx4X%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u1d488035\" id=\"u1d488035\"><span data-lake-id=\"uefb50ef6\" id=\"uefb50ef6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">将模型移动到 GPU 并创建一个训练循环，该循环报告每个 epoch 的损失和困惑度。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20tqdm%20import%20tqdm%5Cn%5Cndevice%20%3D%20%5C%22cuda%5C%22%5Cnmodel%20%3D%20model.to(device)%5Cn%5Cnfor%20epoch%20in%20range(num_epochs)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20model.train()%5Cn%20%20%20%20total_loss%20%3D%200%5Cn%20%20%20%20for%20step%2C%20batch%20in%20enumerate(tqdm(train_dataloader))%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20batch%20%3D%20%7Bk%3A%20v.to(device)%20for%20k%2C%20v%20in%20batch.items()%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20outputs%20%3D%20model(**batch)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20loss%20%3D%20outputs.loss%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20total_loss%20%2B%3D%20loss.detach().float()%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20loss.backward()%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20optimizer.step()%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20lr_scheduler.step()%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20optimizer.zero_grad()%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20model.eval()%5Cn%20%20%20%20eval_loss%20%3D%200%5Cn%20%20%20%20eval_preds%20%3D%20%5B%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20for%20step%2C%20batch%20in%20enumerate(tqdm(eval_dataloader))%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20batch%20%3D%20%7Bk%3A%20v.to(device)%20for%20k%2C%20v%20in%20batch.items()%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20with%20torch.no_grad()%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20outputs%20%3D%20model(**batch)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20loss%20%3D%20outputs.loss%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20eval_loss%20%2B%3D%20loss.detach().float()%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20eval_preds.extend(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20tokenizer.batch_decode(torch.argmax(outputs.logits%2C%20-1).detach().cpu().numpy()%2C%20skip_special_tokens%3DTrue)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20)%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20eval_epoch_loss%20%3D%20eval_loss%20%2F%20len(eval_dataloader)%5Cn%20%20%20%20eval_ppl%20%3D%20torch.exp(eval_epoch_loss)%5Cn%20%20%20%20train_epoch_loss%20%3D%20total_loss%20%2F%20len(train_dataloader)%5Cn%20%20%20%20train_ppl%20%3D%20torch.exp(train_epoch_loss)%5Cn%20%20%20%20print(f%5C%22%7Bepoch%3D%7D%3A%20%7Btrain_ppl%3D%7D%20%7Btrain_epoch_loss%3D%7D%20%7Beval_ppl%3D%7D%20%7Beval_epoch_loss%3D%7D%5C%22)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22o3ng0%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"caafa434\" id=\"caafa434\"><span data-lake-id=\"u10064e5d\" id=\"u10064e5d\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">分享您的模型</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u71deacb2\" id=\"u71deacb2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3f3d6aa9\" id=\"u3f3d6aa9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">训练完成后，您可以使用</span><span data-lake-id=\"uf415e2ab\" id=\"uf415e2ab\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/transformers/v4.49.0/en/main_classes/model#transformers.PreTrainedModel.push_to_hub\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ucf1ba7d2\" id=\"ucf1ba7d2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u92efea85\" id=\"u92efea85\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">push_to_hub</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u48259882\" id=\"u48259882\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u94fd0078\" id=\"u94fd0078\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">方法将您的模型上传到 Hub。您需要先登录您的 Hugging Face 帐户，并在提示时输入您的令牌。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20huggingface_hub%20import%20notebook_login%5Cn%5Cnaccount%20%3D%20%3Cyour-hf-account-name%3E%5Cnpeft_model_id%20%3D%20f%5C%22%7Baccount%7D%2Fmt0-large-ia3%5C%22%5Cnmodel.push_to_hub(peft_model_id)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Zk8dT%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"ed6f7ed8\" id=\"ed6f7ed8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9a842427\" id=\"u9a842427\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">推理</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"ub7f78b58\" id=\"ub7f78b58\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf4494f9c\" id=\"uf4494f9c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">要加载模型进行推理，请使用</span><span data-lake-id=\"u2c8d19eb\" id=\"u2c8d19eb\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/peft/v0.15.0/en/package_reference/auto_class#peft.AutoPeftModel.from_pretrained\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u00fd3c7c\" id=\"u00fd3c7c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0ab92a21\" id=\"u0ab92a21\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">from_pretrained()</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"ub2db9de8\" id=\"ub2db9de8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u4df8620e\" id=\"u4df8620e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">方法。让我们还从数据集中加载一句财经新闻，以生成情感。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20peft%20import%20AutoPeftModelForSeq2SeqLM%5Cn%5Cnmodel%20%3D%20AutoPeftModelForSeq2SeqLM.from_pretrained(%5C%22%3Cyour-hf-account-name%3E%2Fmt0-large-ia3%5C%22).to(%5C%22cuda%5C%22)%5Cntokenizer%20%3D%20AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained(%5C%22bigscience%2Fmt0-large%5C%22)%5Cn%5Cni%20%3D%2015%5Cninputs%20%3D%20tokenizer(ds%5B%5C%22validation%5C%22%5D%5Btext_column%5D%5Bi%5D%2C%20return_tensors%3D%5C%22pt%5C%22)%5Cnprint(ds%5B%5C%22validation%5C%22%5D%5Btext_column%5D%5Bi%5D)%5Cn%5C%22The%20robust%20growth%20was%20the%20result%20of%20the%20inclusion%20of%20clothing%20chain%20Lindex%20in%20the%20Group%20in%20December%202007%20.%5C%22%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lW64c%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u587bbe80\" id=\"u587bbe80\"><span data-lake-id=\"u93703e11\" id=\"u93703e11\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">调用</span><span data-lake-id=\"u36b2451b\" id=\"u36b2451b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/transformers/v4.49.0/en/main_classes/text_generation#transformers.GenerationMixin.generate\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u78d6954f\" id=\"u78d6954f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0d9ad9d2\" id=\"u0d9ad9d2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">generate</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u39dde700\" id=\"u39dde700\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"uad7053e0\" id=\"uad7053e0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">方法来生成预测的情感标签。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22with%20torch.no_grad()%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20inputs%20%3D%20%7Bk%3A%20v.to(device)%20for%20k%2C%20v%20in%20inputs.items()%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20outputs%20%3D%20model.generate(input_ids%3Dinputs%5B%5C%22input_ids%5C%22%5D%2C%20max_new_tokens%3D10)%5Cn%20%20%20%20print(tokenizer.batch_decode(outputs.detach().cpu().numpy()%2C%20skip_special_tokens%3DTrue))%5Cn%5B'positive'%5D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22p7KaR%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card>", "format": "lake", "word_count": 1720, "description": "示例代码ia3-train.zip前言IA3 通过三个学习到的向量来乘模型的激活值（自注意力机制和编码器-解码器注意力模块中的键和值，以及逐位置前馈网络的中间激活值）。这种 PEFT 方法引入的可训练参数数量甚至比 LoRA 更少，LoRA 引入的是权重矩阵而不是向量。原始模型的参数保持冻结，...", "updated_at": "2025-05-07T01:44:19.000Z", "created_at": "2025-05-07T01:44:17.000Z", "id": 218477500, "status": 1}